      "c5_bound": 0.49679524947217085,
      "code": "```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import differential_evolution\n\ndef run(seed=42, budget_s=1000, **kwargs):\n    # Number of sample points (adjustable)\n    n_points = 72\n    dx = 2.0 / n_points\n    \n    # Objective function: minimizes max correlation, with sum constraint penalty\n    def objective(h_values):\n        corr = np.correlate(h_values, 1 - h_values, mode='full')\n        max_corr_val = np.max(corr)\n        c5 = max_corr_val * dx\n        \n        # Penalty to maintain constraint: sum(h_values) == n_points / 2\n        sum_h = np.sum(h_values)\n        penalty = 1e4 * abs(sum_h - n_points / 2)\n        return c5 + penalty\n\n    # Define bounds for all sample points\n    bounds = [(0.0, 1.0) for _ in range(n_points)]\n\n    # Run differential evolution with specified parameters\n    result = differential_evolution(\n        objective,\n        bounds,\n        strategy='best1bin',\n        popsize=15,\n        maxiter=300,\n        tol=1e-5,\n        mutation=(0.5, 1),\n        recombination=0.8,\n        seed=seed\n    )\n\n    # Extract and recompute actual C5 using the optimal h_values\n    h_opt = result.x\n    corr_opt = np.correlate(h_opt, 1 - h_opt, mode='full')\n    max_corr_val_opt = np.max(corr_opt)\n    actual_c5 = max_corr_val_opt * dx\n\n    return h_opt, actual_c5, n_points\n```",
